# GPUI entity updates

Never call `entity.update` on an entity from inside that same entity's update callback or action/event handler.

- Clear or mutate owned fields on `self` (already borrowed), or `cx.defer` work until after the update ends.
- Parent-owned updates are fine when the parent is the updating entity (e.g. Add button → `line_input.update(... clear ...)`).
- Lesson: Enter used to call `Home::submit_line` → `line_input.update(clear)` while already inside `LineInput::submit`, which panics with `cannot update LineInput while it is already being updated` (abort / exit 134). Fix: `on_submit` returns success; `LineInput::submit` clears on `self`.
